@baseUrl = http://localhost:5209
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_ADMIN_TOKEN
@receiptId = REPLACE_WITH_RECEIPT_ID

### Configuration status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All matching receipts, dates inclusive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a receipt manually, no image required
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentTypeDictId": "REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENT_TYPE_DICT_ID"
}

### Save receipt (document type, expense category and site category required; date/amount/currency optional)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/{{receiptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "REPLACE_WITH_RECEIPT_VERSION",
  "documentTypeDictId": "REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENT_TYPE_DICT_ID",
  "type": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNTING_DICT_ID",
  "siteCategoryDictId": "REPLACE_WITH_SITE_CATEGORY_DICT_ID",
  "receiptDate": null,
  "amount": null,
  "currencyCode": null,
  "merchantName": null,
  "invoiceNumber": null,
  "remark": null
}

### Attach or replace the original image (JPEG / PNG, max 4 MB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/{{receiptId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receipt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./receipt.png
--Boundary--

### Recognize saved image (returns suggestions, does not change the receipt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/{{receiptId}}/recognize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete receipt and its original image
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/{{receiptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download all matching original images, not just a page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounting/receipts/export?start=2026-01-01&end=2026-12-31&siteCategoryDictId=REPLACE_WITH_SITE_CATEGORY_DICT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}